          "text": "Make the tiny target treat dax as an alias of red. Public answers: color dax → yes, color red → yes, color blue → no. The host has bound these three cases. This is a guided tool-use smoke test. The known solution is to copy row 3 (red) to row 5 (dax) in embed.weight. Make one native tool call per turn. First call test_behavior with {}. Next call preview_weights with {\"writes\":[{\"tensor\":\"embed.weight\",\"selection\":[5],\"operation\":\"copy\",\"source\":{\"tensor\":\"embed.weight\",\"selection\":[3]}}]}. If the preview fixes dax and preserves the familiar colors, pass the returned candidate_id to commit_preview. Finish with submit_patch({})."
